# Sanity CMS
# Iegūsti no: https://sanity.io/manage → sava projekta iestatījumi

# Google Analytics 4
# Iegūsti no: analytics.google.com → Admin → Data Streams → Measurement ID (G-XXXXXXXXXX)
PUBLIC_GA_MEASUREMENT_ID=G-XXXXXXXXXX

# Microsoft Clarity
# Iegūsti no: clarity.microsoft.com → sava projekta Settings → Project ID
PUBLIC_CLARITY_PROJECT_ID=your_clarity_id_here
